"vermez."
msgstr ""
"The batch-to-batch correlation is significant (lag-1 r = %.2f > %.2f): the reported σ"
" ignores this correlation and underestimates the true uncertainty (%s §IV.A). The "
"source measures an underestimation by a factor of 1.7–4.7 in local tallies (fission "
"rates) (§IV.B Table 2); it gives no magnitude for k-eff."

